# Formatting

When you edit files, format them before finishing the task. Do not ask the user to run formatters manually.

## Python

Run Black on every Python file you create or modify:

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
black path/to/file.py
```

## CSS

Run Prettier on CSS files you create or modify:

```bash
npx prettier --write path/to/file.css
```

Use project config from `.prettierrc`. Prefer formatting only the files you touched.

## Do not Prettier-format

- **Django templates** (`templates/**/*.html`) — breaks `{% %}` and `{{ }}` tags
- **JavaScript** (`static/js/**/*.js`) — can break project conventions; format by hand

These paths are listed in `.prettierignore`. Format templates and JS by hand to match surrounding style.
